parent 85b0d253b5bde32ad4db24c0a96cf4c540fd205b
author zichuanxu <zichuanxu28@gmail.com> 1792249557 +0900
committer zichuanxu <zichuanxu28@gmail.com> 1792249557 +0900

Public release layout after top-venue practice: no paper in the package, data out of paper/, English docs

- paper/audit -> audit/ and paper/results_sources.json -> results/sources.json; every reader
  follows; paper/generated regenerates byte for byte. audit/neighbours/verify.py finds the
  repository root again after the move.
- tests/conftest.py: a `paper` marker skips tests that read paper/ when it is absent (the
  package passes make check without it).
- make_release: no paper/, STATUS or FINAL_REPORT in the package; audit/, results/, CI,
  CITATION.cff, docs/COMPUTE.md and docs/PREREGISTRATION_EN.md in; README from
  docs/release/README.md; Cognee manifests (211 MB of store hashes) go to the Hugging Face
  dataset; per-run hash checks ship; the scan matches internal names anywhere (no word
  boundaries) and covers every non-binary file; the package Makefile has no release target.
- make smoke runs offline (one world from a seed, hashes re-checked); .env.example lists every
  key the code reads; pyproject names the authors and the MIT license; scripts no longer cite
  the internal compute handbook; CI runs make check and the registration-history verifier.
- English docs: release README (data on the HF dataset zichuanxu/memshift, code MIT, data
  CC BY 4.0), CITATION.cff, compute summary, a non-normative English summary of the
  registrations, audit/ and results/ READMEs, the HF dataset card.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
